From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JetBox build <build@jetbox.invalid>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 15:11:52 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] jetbox: do not send hardware identifiers or the system
 hostname

The service no longer collects the system serial number, model and
manufacturer, reports network addresses without MAC, and never sends the
OS hostname. The device name is the one the app passes in Login/Up
(hostname); it is persisted in the state directory so peer metadata keeps
it after restarts, with a neutral "JetBox" until one is set. OS, version
and local IPs are sent as upstream does.
